* 输出 — 注释更正 (2026-06-12): 旧注释声称 "esttab 部分缺失 spec 时仍输出可用列" 不实 —
* esttab 对缺名估计是 r(111) 硬崩 (同 12_table3 fix(omni-g-templates-14) 实证)。
* fix(S1-03, 2026-06-16): 改为动态名单化 (同 12_table3/13_table4/21_tableA2 idiom) —
* 仅引用实际已存储的估计, mtitle 同步删列防错位, 任一词典列缺失时优雅降级不再整表崩。
qui estimates dir
local stored `r(names)'
* du_2022 以政治词权重三元组 (pw=0 / pw=.5 / pw=1) 并排, 中列 DICT_du_2022 即 pw=.5 (du_2022_tone);
* 三权重不分主次, 与其余 5 部词典单列同排。缺列由上方 capture-confirm 守卫 → 动态名单化优雅降级。
local cand_models LLM_main DICT_jiang_2021 DICT_yao_2021 DICT_bian_2021 DU_pw0 DICT_du_2022 DU_pw1 DICT_you_2018 DICT_loughran LM_negonly
local cand_titles `""LLM ensemble" "Jiang 2021" "Yao 2021" "Bian 2021" "Du22 pw=0" "Du22 pw=.5" "Du22 pw=1" "You 2018" "L-M 2026" "L-M counts""'
local models ""
local mtitles `""'
local nmod : word count `cand_models'
forvalues i = 1/`nmod' {
    local m : word `i' of `cand_models'
    if `: list m in stored' {
        local models `models' `m'
        local t : word `i' of `cand_titles'
        local mtitles `"`mtitles' "`t'""'
    }
}
if "`models'" == "" {
    display as error "  ⚠️ Table A5 无任何已存储估计 (LLM/词典列全缺), 表跳过"
}
else {
    esttab `models' using "output/tables/tableA5_dictionary_method.tex", ///
        se star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) ///
        booktabs replace fragment ///
        title("Table A5: LLM vs Dictionary-Based Sentiment (Robustness)") ///
        mtitles(`mtitles') ///
        note("DV: 情感分数. LLM = 3 模型多数投票. Dict = 6 个中文金融词典 (含 Loughran-McDonald 2011 JF 中文全译 L-M 2026). " ///
             "L-M counts = loughran negonly (仅否定, 去程度/转折), 最接近 L&M 原版纯计数; 与 L-M 2026 (全规则) 并排验稳健性. " ///
             "Du22 pw={0,.5,1} = 政治词权重敏感性 (Du et al. 2022, Review of Finance): 政治正面词信号弱于普通正面词, 故以降低权重计入; " ///
             "0.5 为研究者选择, 三权重互为稳健性、不分主次 (pw=.5 = 主口径 du_2022_tone), 证明结论不被该取值驱动; 三列各自 just-identified. " ///
             "IDENTIFICATION NOTE: digital_frontier is a base-year within-bank time-invariant 0/1 classifier; every " ///
             "column here uses absorb(bank_id year), so it is collinear with the bank FE and silently dropped — " ///
             "beta(digital_frontier) is identified only in a no-absorb column (see 11_table2 M1). These columns identify " ///
             "the within-bank time-varying terms (LOCUS/SUBST controls); the comparison is across sentiment measures, not " ///
             "across the frontier main effect.")

    display "✅ Table A5 written to output/tables/tableA5_dictionary_method.tex"
}
